From ccff4dffdfedeb92182e9fb147f6c10a70cdd207 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:32:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wayland: Implement gtk_shell1 so GTK menus reach the global
 menu

Native Wayland GTK windows only announce their D-Bus menus through
gtk_shell1, which KWin didn't implement, so the global menu stayed
empty. Implement its D-Bus properties and pass them on to appmenu.

BUG: 424485
